, "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">\"D\u00e9crocher un emploi\"</span> signifie obtenir un emploi. <span class=\"italic\">\"L'emploi de vos r\u00eaves\"</span> est votre emploi id\u00e9al. Pierre parle d'un livre titr\u00e9 <span class=\"italic\">\"D\u00e9crocher l'emploi de vos r\u00eaves\"</span>. ", "tip_id": 2, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Consignes : <span class=\"bullet\">\u00c9coutez le dialogue encore une fois.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">D\u00e9placez les mots dans les cases pour compl\u00e9ter les phrases correctement.</span> <span class = \"bullet\">Enregistrez-vous en disant les m\u00eames phrases \u00e0 voix haute</span>. <span class = \"bullet\">Comparez-vous aux enregistrements</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\nVous avez deux essais pour soumettre vos r\u00e9ponses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "frn2le03ob08re2aud01", "type": "audio"}]}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "es-tu", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Pierre,", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "en train de v\u00e9rifier tes m\u00e9ls ?", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_2", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0}, {"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "je vois", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Oui ! Oh,", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "un nouveau m\u00e9l dans ma bo\u00eete de r\u00